启策略，使 Pod 陷入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 循环（证据 #2, #3）。\n\n**未知/缺失信息**：目前只能确认“应用内部异常”这一表象，由于缺乏应用堆栈跟踪（Stack Trace）或具体的 Python 错误日志，**无法确认**导致 `/work` 接口返回 500 的具体 Python 代码逻辑或具体的依赖缺失。现有工具事实（K8s State, Logging, Tracing）已足以解释当前的故障状态，但不足以支撑对应用代码层面的精确定位。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 74.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8: 74.0s (Evidence 65.2s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 108.124, "metrics": {"run_id": "1abdca3694d241ed", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.12805557250977, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence